<title>USA: Tengasco holders go after loan arranger.</title>
<headline>Tengasco holders go after loan arranger.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tengasco Inc said Monday that a special meeting of shareholders approved a move to take to court a man who placed loans for the company but terms of which its board have rejected.</p>
<p>In a statement, Tengasco said a resolution calling for a shareholder lawsuit against Heike Theime, his associates or other persons was approved by those who attended the special meeting.</p>
<p>The loans, totalling $1 million, were borrowed by the company in the fall last year.</p>
</text>
